ages regardless of ambient lighting, so it generates its own light rather than relying on reflection of external light. I'll also address the "totally different" feeling: it's not totally different in principle of color mixing (light entering eye), just in the way the light is generated. Then I'll reassure them that they're not wrong about the fundamentals.
